number: XXI
name: The Æon
path: M7.668 1v8.332a1.666 1.666 0 1 0 1.664-1.664C6 7.668 6 11 2.668 11a1.667 1.667 0 1 1 0-3.332M4.332 1v5M1 6h10M1 3.5h10
uprightMeaning: reckoning, awakening, summons
